      },
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Anomalies per day by kind and baseline mode",
      "description": "One bar segment per kind and baseline mode, coloured by mode (TRAILING red, SAME_DOW amber, HOUR_OF_WEEK blue, level shifts grey), so a day two modes flagged shows two segments. HOUR_OF_WEEK counts flagged hours. TBSPC_GROWTH: tablespace growth rate; CPU_BUSY / DBCPU_BUSY: host CPU / a container's DB CPU; SERIES_LEVEL / SERIES_GROWTH: workload series; CPU_SHIFT: a container's DB CPU moved to a new level and stayed there (counted on the last day of its recent window).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "datasource",
        "uid": "-- Dashboard --"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "datasource",
            "uid": "-- Dashboard --"
          },
          "panelId": 1,
          "withTransforms": false
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "merge",
          "options": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "groupBy",
          "options": {
            "fields": {
              "obs_day": {
                "aggregations": [],
                "operation": "groupby"
              },
              "anomaly_kind": {
                "aggregations": [],
                "operation": "groupby"
              },
              "baseline_mode": {
                "aggregations": [],
                "operation": "groupby"
              },
              "sev_rank": {
                "aggregations": [
                  "count"
                ],
                "operation": "aggregate"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "partitionByValues",
          "options": {
